<section class="section bg-mist rule-top">
  <div class="wrap grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="eyebrow">Access controls</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Limit Access to What Each Role Needs</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Unique user accounts, with no shared logins</li>
        <li>Role-based permissions</li>
        <li>Multi-factor authentication where appropriate</li>
        <li>Review of privileged and administrator accounts</li>
        <li>Prompt account termination when staff leave</li>
        <li>Periodic, documented access reviews</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="eyebrow">Email &amp; communication</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Control How PHI Leaves the Organization</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>PHI sent to incorrect recipients</li>
        <li>Use of personal email accounts</li>
        <li>Unapproved automatic forwarding</li>
        <li>Insecure file-sharing links</li>
        <li>Unapproved messaging apps</li>
        <li>Weak identity verification before disclosure</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
