          <li>Credential theft</li>
          <li>Ransomware</li>
          <li>Compromised email and user accounts</li>
          <li>Vendor compromise</li>
          <li>Malicious or accidental insider activity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="margin-layout">
