        <table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Common mistake</th><th scope="col">Control that reduces it</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Clicking a phishing link</td><td>Awareness training, email filtering, multi-factor authentication</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Sending records to the wrong patient</td><td>Verification steps before release, workflow review</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Texting PHI from a personal phone</td><td>Approved communication tools and a clear policy</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Viewing records without a work reason</td><td>Role-based access, activity review, sanctions policy</td></tr>
